   "level": 1,
   "statement": "<p>Among <code>n</code> numbers, find two (at different positions) whose difference is as small as possible, and print that difference. Two equal numbers have difference 0.</p>",
   "input": "<p>The first line holds <code>n</code>. The second line holds <code>n</code> integers.</p>",
