   "hint": "<p>Sort, then look at <code>a[i + 1] − a[i]</code> for every <code>i</code>.</p>",
   "solution": "n = int(input())\na = list(map(int, input().split()))\nfor i in range(n - 1):\n    m = i\n    for j in range(i + 1, n):\n        if a[j] < a[m]:\n            m = j\n    a[i], a[m] = a[m], a[i]\nbest = 0\nfor i in range(n - 1):\n    best = max(best, a[i + 1] - a[i])\nprint(best)",
