   "solution": "n = int(input())\na = list(map(int, input().split()))\nfor i in range(n - 1):\n    for j in range(n - 1 - i):\n        if a[j] < a[j + 1]:\n            a[j], a[j + 1] = a[j + 1], a[j]\nh = 0\nfor i in range(n):\n    if a[i] >= i + 1:\n        h = i + 1\nprint(h)",
